784d.mp4?t=1727543244\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><strong>New Daily Challenge</strong>: Compete daily with your friends on a new randomized course!<br><br><br><br><strong>Additional Features:</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Proximity voice chat<br></li><li>Vents, traps, and cameras<br></li><li>Unique workplace-themed roles<br></li><li>Interesting tasks, weapons, and items<br></li><li>Active and growing community</li></ul>",
